SUMMARY:The Emotion Scent Journey
DESCRIPTION:What might a fragrance crafted by your own hands reveal? Discover the connection between scents and emotions\, and how certain fragrances can bring back memories and influence the way we feel. Through a variety of aromatic notes\, participants will create their own scent bag by selecting and blending fragrances that reflect their personality and emotions.
